          "draft": {
            "heroMessage": "Helping You Buy and Sell Homes in the Chattanooga Area",
            "welcomeNote": "Welcome! I’m John Holden, a Chattanooga local who’s proudly called this area home for 30 years. I’m passionate about making your real estate journey as smooth and enjoyable as possible.",
            "tagline": "Dedicated. Energetic. Focused on your goals.",
            "aboutParagraph": "As an Affiliate Broker with Realty One Group Experts, I bring a unique blend of experience—from serving in the Marine Corps, to managing a beloved local restaurant, to guiding clients seamlessly through buying and selling their homes. My commitment is to provide you with professional expertise, responsive communication, and a deep knowledge of Chattanooga’s neighborhoods. Whether you’re searching for your dream home or looking to sell, I leverage cutting-edge technology and my personal attentiveness to deliver results that exceed your expectations.",
            "conciergeLine": "Get in touch for a no-obligation consultation—let’s talk about your Chattanooga real estate goals today.",
            "contactLine": "Call me at (423) 314-8761 or (423) 541-0100. I look forward to working with you!",
