  "reviewText": "Back\nAPP BUILDER\njohnholdenhomes.com\nChange\nHere’s your app\nYour branding, content and listings are ready to review. Explore themes or preview your app before publishing.\nCHATTANOOGA, TN\nFind Your Dream Home in Chattanooga\nChattanooga-based John Holden Homes are a realtor / broker dedicated to helping you achieve your real estate goals at the highest standards.\nView listings\nHomes I picked\nfor you.\nNew listings will appear here as your realtor adds them. Get in touch to discuss your search.\n(423) 314-8761\nguest+realtor+a6ebf07f-8d47-4d81-b193-9969b3ea27e9@guest.myrealtor.app\nRealty One Group Experts\nHome\nListings\nSaved\nChat\nProfile\nMy Website · how your clients will see the opening screen\nOPENING LINE\nHelping You Buy and Sell Homes in the Chattanooga Area\nTry another opening line\nYOUR INTRODUCTION\nAs an Affiliate Broker with Realty One Group Experts, I bring a unique blend of experience—from serving in the Marine Corps, to managing a beloved local restaurant, to guiding clients seamlessly through buying and selling their homes. My commitment is to provide you with professional expertise, responsive communication, and a deep knowledge of Chattanooga’s neighborhoods. Whether you’re searching for your dream home or looking to sell, I leverage cutting-edge technology and my personal attentiveness to deliver results that exceed your expectations.\nTry another introduction\nBring in your listings\nPaste the page where your listings live. We’ll figure out the rest.\nImport my listings\nWe couldn’t find your listings on that page. Try pasting the page where all of your active listings are shown. The page must open without signing in.\nAdd your portrait\nRecommended — your app opens on your photo.\nChoose a photo\nPlease confirm\nWe found these — fix anything that’s wrong.\nPhone\nAlso found: (423) 541-0100\n▸ Brokerage & license (optional)\n✓ Realty One Group Experts\nMake it yours\nExplore themes with your imported content and lis